    skos:note "Every FIBO IRI and maturity used here was rechecked on 3 November 2026 against raw .rdf files from master at GitHub commit 33a92cd34285d532c158da97bb42add089f135d3 (27 October 2026). Each term's maturity level, Release or Provisional, is taken from the file that defines it." .

